378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 238 0 R
/T (In most existing systems, solar panels are improved using dual-axis tracking and simple MPPT methods to get more power from sunlight. These setups often include IoT features, so users can monitor performance remotely through mobile apps or cloud platforms. While they do increase energy output compared to fixed panels, they still depend on basic sensors and conventional control techniques, which makes them less effective when weather conditions change or when there is partial shading. Drawbacks:)
/E (In most existing systems, solar panels are improved using dual-axis tracking and simple MPPT methods to get more power from sunlight. These setups often include IoT features, so users can monitor performance remotely through mobile apps or cloud platforms. While they do increase energy output compared to fixed panels, they still depend on basic sensors and conventional control techniques, which makes them less effective when weather conditions change or when there is partial shading. Drawbacks:)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
