<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 239 0 R
/T (Problem statement: Current solar systems cannot utilize full sunlight due to fixed panels, basic tracking, and simple MPPT methods. They also struggle under changing weather and partial shading, and often depend too much on internet connectivity. This leads to reduced efficiency and unreliable performance.  Objectives:)
/E (Problem statement: Current solar systems cannot utilize full sunlight due to fixed panels, basic tracking, and simple MPPT methods. They also struggle under changing weather and partial shading, and often depend too much on internet connectivity. This leads to reduced efficiency and unreliable performance.  Objectives:)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
