491 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 244 0 R
/T (The proposed system shows a clear improvement in solar energy generation compared to conventional methods. By combining dual-axis tracking with MPPT and IoT monitoring, the system is able to capture more sunlight and extract maximum power throughout the day. It performs better even under changing weather conditions, providing stable and efficient output, while also allowing users to monitor performance easily in real time.)
/E (The proposed system shows a clear improvement in solar energy generation compared to conventional methods. By combining dual-axis tracking with MPPT and IoT monitoring, the system is able to capture more sunlight and extract maximum power throughout the day. It performs better even under changing weather conditions, providing stable and efficient output, while also allowing users to monitor performance easily in real time.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
