501 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 245 0 R
/T (The project successfully demonstrates an efficient and intelligent solar energy system by combining dual-axis tracking,MPPT, and IoT monitoring, resulting in improved power output and better reliability compared to conventional systems. It shows that smart control and real-time monitoring can significantly enhance solar performance. In the future, the system can be further improved by integrating more advanced AI algorithms, battery management systems, and smart grid connectivity, making it more scalable, cost-effective, and suitable for large-scale real-world applications.)
/E (The project successfully demonstrates an efficient and intelligent solar energy system by combining dual-axis tracking,MPPT, and IoT monitoring, resulting in improved power output and better reliability compared to conventional systems. It shows that smart control and real-time monitoring can significantly enhance solar performance. In the future, the system can be further improved by integrating more advanced AI algorithms, battery management systems, and smart grid connectivity, making it more scalable, cost-effective, and suitable for large-scale real-world applications.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
