/Title (Problem statement: Current solar systems cannot utilize full sunlight due to fixed panels, basic tracking, and simple MPPT methods. They also struggle under changing weather and partial shading, and often depend too much on internet connectivity. This leads to reduced efficiency and unreliable performance.  Objectives:)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1454 0 R
/Next 1461 0 R
>>
endobj
1461 0 obj
<<
/Title (To develop a dual-axis tracking system for maximum sunlight capture. To implement MPPT for better power extraction. To enable IoT-based real-time monitoring. To add generative AIfor smart optimization. To make the system efficient, reliable, and less dependent on internet.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1454 0 R
/Prev 1460 0 R
>>
endobj
